<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τροφή</span>
			, as etym. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλαξ, βουκόλος,
				δύσκολος</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλία</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				6.262a
			</span></i>, copied by <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1817.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				62
			</span></i> (who adds <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκολος</span>); applied
			to some form of preserved food in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				5.535.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				46
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>colon</i>, part of the large intestine, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				455
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				675b7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.209
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολόροβ-ον</span></b>  and
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολόκυντ-ος</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολλόροβον</span>
			 IV.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
